.md
The only problem is that `Legended` __does not support__ `Offload`; in other words, it cannot be updated. When a user deselects a checkbox, the legend should disappear. How do we fix that?

Full reevaluation:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
The only problem is that `Legended` __does not support__ `Offload`; in other words, it cannot be updated. When a user deselects a checkbox, the legend should disappear. How do we fix that?

Full reevaluation:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
refresh = EventObject[];
showGallaiEdmonds = False;
Refresh[makeLegends[Graphics[Disk[], ImageSize->100], False, showGallaiEdmonds], refresh]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
(*VB[*)(Null)(*,*)(*"1:eJxdjkkLwjAUhOsCLv9C8FpoYxrxqigKLtCK50byHgZCollQ/71RqQcvw8cwb96MzqbEVpIkrhtlbZTAN7hhlBLQgrvMzQM7jbcU0ht7knD/XvWiHBCV4cJNIy8MIsBW3gIEWy8fHrSTRrt6x7W8BsU91BvtwWquauftOGczRgm2mwllUFD1P9+5OGj1/LhHG+AvM4iwCkqV4MD/QtU4AlLIiiKHFBllKZ1MecoZO6cImaAZITkpiEyatn0seQFFzUMd"*)(*]VB*)

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
